@startuml trace-07-profile
title 7. Perfil Trace — estereótipos e restrições do domínio
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class TraceIndustrialProfile <<profile>>
class LocalFirstNode <<stereotype>>
class OutboundSync <<stereotype>>
class IndustrialGateway <<stereotype>>
class PhysicalController <<stereotype>>
class EvidenceArtifact <<stereotype>>
class TenantScopedData <<stereotype>>

LocalFirstNode ..> TraceIndustrialProfile : definido em
OutboundSync ..> TraceIndustrialProfile : definido em
IndustrialGateway ..> TraceIndustrialProfile : definido em
PhysicalController ..> TraceIndustrialProfile : definido em
EvidenceArtifact ..> TraceIndustrialProfile : definido em
TenantScopedData ..> TraceIndustrialProfile : definido em

note right of LocalFirstNode
tag: operation=offline-capable
tag: host=industrial-pc
end note
note right of OutboundSync
tag: transport=HTTPS
constraint: conexão iniciada pelo PC
end note
note right of IndustrialGateway
tag: protocol=Modbus TCP
constraint: autentica e valida comandos
end note
note right of PhysicalController
constraint: emergência e intertravamentos no CLP
end note
note right of EvidenceArtifact
tag: media=PDF
tag: storage=filesystem
end note
note right of TenantScopedData
tag: key=company_id
constraint: consultas respeitam a empresa autorizada
end note

note bottom
Modelo de perfil do Trace para padronizar estereótipos e tags.
Representado com classes UML para compatibilidade com PlantUML.
end note
@enduml
